# WoW CVars applied before launch in desk mode (name value)
renderScale 0.75333333015442
ResampleQuality 3
vsync 0
maxFPS 60
GxMaximize 1
# Sound: System Default device (follows the desktop output)
Sound_EnableAllSound 1
Sound_OutputDriverIndex 0
Sound_OutputDriverName System Default
# Controls (GamePadEnable, gamepad UI, soft targeting) follow the controller: see INPUT_CVARS in couch
